      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate, attentive veterinary staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently commend Dr. Gutierrez, Dr. Borroto, and the hospital technicians for their attentive bedside manner and genuine love for animals. Pet owners describe feeling supported and welcomed during every visit, though one owner noted a frustrating scheduling encounter before a lunch break."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Tender care for fragile pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers praise the team's gentle, loving approach to pets of all ages, including fragile senior cats, playful kittens, and rescued strays. Owners note that the technicians and veterinarians handle nervous pets with calming patience, ensuring animals receive stress-free wellness exams and treatment."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear medical guidance and follow-ups"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents appreciate how clearly veterinarians explain diagnoses, treatment choices, and surgical procedures without rushing. Several clients specifically mention evening follow-up calls from doctors checking on recovering pets, making families feel well-informed and supported throughout care."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What veterinary services are provided at West Kendall Animal Hospital?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The hospital provides comprehensive wellness exams, vaccinations, dental procedures, surgery, and management for chronic illnesses."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How do doctors communicate with pet owners during treatment?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently praise the veterinarians for clear medical explanations, open discussions of options, and personal follow-up calls."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the clinic care for rescue animals and stray pets?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers share positive experiences bringing in rescued strays and orphaned kittens for compassionate and affordable care."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
